Subject: [PATCH] drm/stm: ltdc: add clock tolerance module parameter

[ 634d4d01d037c not applied due to merge conflict ]

Clock tolerance is set by default to 0.5% (HDMI requirement).
Via a module parameter, it is possible to modify it (useful for debug).

